{%- comment -%}
  Hook that al-folio's bib layout includes for every publication, right after it builds the
  venue text in `entrytype`; whatever is left in `entrytype` is what the page shows.
  Shows arXiv preprints as "arXiv, 2026" instead of "arXiv preprint arXiv:2611.33368, 2026".
  The BibTeX behind the "Bib" button keeps the full journal field.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- if entry.journal contains 'arXiv preprint' -%}
  {%- capture entrytype -%}<em>arXiv</em>{%- endcapture -%}
{%- endif -%}
